摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Compact DeepSeek Harness desktop host with a native SwiftUI iPhone Remote source preview.","id":"gh:1334305310","install_available":false,"language":"Kotlin","name":"deepseek-harness-desktop","slug":"chokwinlee/deepseek-harness-desktop","topics":["ai-agents","coding-agent","cross-platform","deepseek","deepseek-harness","desktop","desktop-app","dsh","dsh-plugin","electron","ios","lightweight","macos","remote-development","swiftui","tailscale","tauri","windows"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Compact DeepSeek Harness desktop host with a native SwiftUI iPhone Remote source preview."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DSH Desktop\nA compact, self-contained DeepSeek Harness desktop host with native iPhone and Android R"},{"id":"p2s2","text":"pact, self-contained DeepSeek Harness desktop host with native iPhone and Android Remote companions."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Download\n· Highlights\n· iPhone Remote\n· Android Remote\n· Development\n· Contributing"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English\n· 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"*macOS DMGs around 100 MB, with the complete Harness runtime included.*"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"DSH Desktop runs the official DeepSeek Harness Web UI and runtime in a desktop window. The repositor"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"y also contains DSH Remote native companions for continuing the computer's projects, sessions, and r"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"unning tasks from iPhone and Android. This build is aligned with `@deepseek-ai/dsh@0.1.5-rc.2` and s"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"hows that bundled Harness version in the sidebar. The desktop app manages the local Harness process "},{"id":"p6s5","text":"automatically, so users do not need to install Node.js or start `dsh web` themselves."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Migration and rollback notes"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> [!IMPORTANT]\n> This is an independent community project, not an official DeepSeek AI product. Deep"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"Seek Harness is a developer preview and may introduce breaking changes."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Multimodal sessions** — paste or attach images and send them through the normal Harness conversa"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"tion flow when the selected provider and model declare image input support. Image messages remain vi"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"sible in session history.\n- **Usage at a glance on macOS** — see today and seven-day token totals, e"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"stimated cost, active task count, and aggregate running throughput without leaving the current sessi"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"on.\n- **Compact macOS package** — around 100 MB while bundling the complete Harness runtime, using T"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"auri and the system WKWebView instead of shipping Chromium.\n- **Visible runtime alignment** — the si"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"debar identifies both the Desktop release and its bundled Harness version, such as `DSH Desktop v0.5"},{"id":"p10s8","text":".0 · Harness 0.1.5-rc.2`.\n- **Ready to run** — includes everything needed to start Harness, with no "},{"id":"p10s9","text":"separate Node.js installation or terminal command. The app starts and stops the local runtime automa"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"tically.\n- **Native mobile Remote** — the SwiftUI iPhone client and Kotlin/Compose Android client pa"},{"id":"p10s11","text":"ir on trusted Wi-Fi or the user's own Tailscale network, then browse projects, create sessions, stee"},{"id":"p10s12","text":"r tasks, handle approvals, send images, and follow subagents without moving execution off the comput"},{"id":"p10s13","text":"asks, handle approvals, send images, and follow subagents without moving execution off the computer."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Cost figures are estimates derived from local token logs and available public model prices. Unmatche"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"d models stay visibly unpriced rather than being counted as free."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Multimodal and usage insights"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"*A real Harness rc.8 image-input session with live token and cost insights, using `google/gemini-2.5"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"-flash-lite` through OpenRouter.*"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The compact title-bar summary stays visible while you work. Open it for input, output, cache, cost, "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"and live-throughput details. Usage is calculated locally from Harness session history, with estimate"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"d costs based on available public model prices."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## iPhone Remote (TestFlight beta)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"> [!IMPORTANT]\n> DSH Remote is available as a public iPhone beta. Join with TestFlight."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Same-Wi-Fi pairing · Projects and running sessions · Approval handling"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"DSH Remote is a native SwiftUI companion for a DSH Desktop computer you own or manage. It does not r"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"un an agent, repository, terminal, or model provider on the phone. Work continues on the computer; t"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"he iPhone is a narrow control surface."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The iOS TestFlight beta follows the device's app-language setting and includes complete English and "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"Simplified Chinese product copy, including setup, errors, notifications, approvals, models, Activity"},{"id":"p19s3","text":", and subagent flows."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **Same Wi-Fi (recommended):** Desktop exposes an opt-in, authenticated LAN endpoint on a trusted p"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"rivate network. No Tailscale account is required.\n- **Away from the local network:** both devices jo"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"in the user's own tailnet, and Desktop configures a private Tailscale Serve HTTPS entry. Do not use "},{"id":"p20s4","text":"Funnel.\n- **No project-operated relay:** code, prompts, model credentials, tool execution, and sessi"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"on history remain on the user's computer."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Install with TestFlight"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"1. Install Apple's TestFlight app on an iPhone running iOS 17 or later.\n2. Open the DSH Remote publi"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"c invitation, choose **View in TestFlight**, then accept and install the beta.\n3. Install the curren"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"t DSH Desktop release on the computer before pairing."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Build from source with Xcode"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Developers can also install the source on their own iPhone with Xcode:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"1. Install Xcode 16 or later on a Mac and sign in under **Xcode → Settings → Accounts**.\n2. Clone th"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"is repository and open `ios/DSHRemote/DSHRemote.xcodeproj`.\n3. Select the `DSHRemote` target, choose"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" your Team under **Signing & Capabilities**, and use a unique bundle identifier if automatic signing"},{"id":"p25s4","text":" requests one.\n4. Connect an iPhone running iOS 17 or later, select it as the run destination, and c"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"hoose **Product → Run**."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"A free Apple Account can use an Xcode Personal Team for personal on-device testing, but the app must"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" be re-provisioned periodically. Downloading an unsigned or unrelated IPA from GitHub will not work."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Pair and use Remote"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"1. Install and open the latest DSH Desktop build.\n2. In Desktop, open **Settings → General → Mobile "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"Remote → Connect phone**.\n3. On the same trusted Wi-Fi, start local pairing and scan the QR code in "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"DSH Remote.\n4. For cellular or other remote networks, open the built-in Tailscale setup guide on Des"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ktop or iPhone, enable anywhere access, and scan the HTTPS QR code.\n5. Open a project, create or con"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"tinue a session, and keep all execution on the computer."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"See the iOS TestFlight and source guide, Chinese Tailscale setup guide, privacy policy, support note"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"s, and App Review notes."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Android Remote (GitHub release)"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"> [!IMPORTANT]\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The project does not fork or reimplement the Harness agent runtime. The shell owns desktop packaging"},{"id":"p34s2","text":", process lifecycle, navigation boundaries, recovery, native integration, and release verification."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
